    <string name="service_label">Sentence Buddy</string>
    <string name="service_description">Reads the text you type so Sentence Buddy can suggest better English sentences, and writes the sentence you choose back into the text box. Your text is only sent to Google Gemini to create suggestions. Password fields are never read.</string>

