    <string name="section_guide">How to use</string>
    <string name="guide_text">1. Save your Gemini API key and tap Test.\n2. Tap Enable and turn on Sentence Buddy in Accessibility settings.\n3. Open WhatsApp and type a sentence.\n4. Pause for a moment: better sentences pop up above the keyboard.\n5. Tap a sentence to put it in the text box. The tiny bubble (drag it anywhere) shows the suggestions again.</string>
