    <string name="dialog_enable_title">Turn on the service</string>
    <string name="dialog_enable_message">In the next screen open \"Installed apps\" (or \"Downloaded apps\"), tap Sentence Buddy and switch it on.\n\nIf the switch is greyed out (Android 13+ for apps installed from an APK): open App info, tap the ⋮ menu and choose \"Allow restricted settings\", then try again.</string>
